<title>FINLAND: JAMES CAPEL SAYS LOWERS SAMPO TO &quot;SELL&quot;.</title>
<headline>JAMES CAPEL SAYS LOWERS SAMPO TO &quot;SELL&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>James Capel has lowered its recommendation for Finnish insurance company Vakuutusosakeyhtio Sampo to &quot;sell&quot; from &quot;hold&quot;, a James Capel equities analyst told Reuters by telephone on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He also said James Capel was maintaining its &quot;buy&quot; rating for Sampo's rival Vakuutusosakeyhtio Pohjola .</p>
<p>No details were available.</p>
<p>---Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 248</p>
</text>
